{"id":"en_i-managed-money-for-my-best-friend-only-to-end-up-owing-her-over-a-million-us-dollars","title":"I managed money for my best friend, only to end up owing her over a million US dollars","titleEn":"I managed money for my best friend, only to end up owing her over a million US dollars","description":"Selena spent three years safeguarding 600,000 yuan on behalf of her closest friend, Joanna. Rather than showing gratitude, Joanna took the money, invented a medical procedure as cover, and pinned the embezzlement on Selena, using the scheme to launch herself as an influencer. Selena lost her life in a car accident. Given a second chance after rebirth, she brought the theft to light, and Joanna was taken into custody for misappropriating company funds. Selena also revealed Jayden's infidelity, ended the relationship, and recovered her property. She went on to establish a studio dedicated to empowering women, engaged in charitable work, and built a family of her own. Joanna and Jayden ultimately fell into poverty, while Selena found fulfillment by bettering herself. Those interested can foll","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-managed-money-for-my-best-friend-only-to-end-up-owing-her-over-a-million-us-dollars/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-managed-money-for-my-best-friend-only-to-end-up-owing-her-over-a-million-us-dollars/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Female Empowerment","Karma Payback","Modern Romance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlcx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-managed-money-for-my-best-friend-only-to-end-up-owing-her-over-a-million-us-dollars_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlcx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":f